d level of detail together.</p></div><div data-reveal="" class="reveal" style="--reveal-delay:90ms;grid-column:9 / 13"><a class="tlink" href="#quote-form"><span>Send the brief first</span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4.5 11.5l7-7M5.5 4.5h6v6"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></section><section class="section section--flush-top" aria-labelledby="faq-heading"><div class="wrap"><div class="sechead"><div data-reveal="" class="reveal sechead__mark"><span class="index-num">01</span></div><div data-reveal="" class="reveal sechead__main" style="--reveal-delay:60ms"><h2 id="faq-heading" class="sechead__title">Questions we are asked most.</h2><p class="sechead__intro">If your question is not here, put it in the project description and we will answer it directly.</p></div></div><div class="grid"><div style="grid-column:1 / 11"><div><div class="disclosure"><h3 style="margin:0"><button type="button" id="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-0" class="disclosure__btn" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-0"><span>Can BB quote from early design information?</span><span class="disclosure__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-0" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-0"><p class="disclosure__panel">Yes. Concept plans, massing models and reference renders are enough for an indicative scope. The quotation will note which items must be confirmed before production.</p></div></div><div class="disclosure"><h3 style="margin:0"><button type="button" id="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-1" class="disclosure__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-1"><span>Which file formats can you use?</span><span class="disclosure__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-1" hidden=""><p class="disclosure__panel">PDF, DWG, DXF, RVT, SKP, 3DM and common image formats are useful. Clean, coordinated files reduce preparation time, but BB can advise on incomplete information.</p></div></div><div class="disclosure"><h3 style="margin:0"><button type="button" id="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-2" class="disclosure__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-2"><span>How do you calculate price?</span><span class="disclosure__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-2" hidden=""><p class="disclosure__panel">Every model is custom. Price depends on physical size, scale, geometry, façade depth, landscape, lighting, removable parts, finish, deadline, case, packing and installation.</p></div></div><div class="disclosure"><h3 style="margin:0"><button type="button" id="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-3" class="disclosure__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-3"><span>How long does a model take?</span><span class="disclosure__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-3" hidden=""><p class="disclosure__panel">Timing varies with scope and review cycles. BB will provide a programme with quotation and identify the dates when information and approvals are required.</p></div></div><div class="disclosure"><h3 style="margin:0"><button type="button" id="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-4" class="disclosure__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-4"><span>Can you add lighting and interactive controls?</span><span class="disclosure__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button></h3><div id="_R_2hbsnrb_-panel-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_2hbsnrb_-button-4" hidden=""><p class="disclosure__panel">Yes. Lighting can be static, zoned, dimmable or programmed for specific presentation sequences. We recommend the simplest system that communicates the project clearly.</p></div></div><div class="disclosure"><h3 styl